'' UDT layout. Every number here was measured by compiling and RUNNING a probe under
'' fbc (tools/gen/udt-truth.py); the full 18-shape differential is
'' tools/gen/check-udt.sh.
''
'' The union is the one to watch. fbc puts BOTH members at offset 8 -- the run is
'' aligned to its WIDEST member, not its first -- and laying them sequentially still
'' produced the right size and the right offsets on either side. The shape passed the
'' gate until the probe was strengthened to ask where the union's own members were.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-udt tests/types/src/udt.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: ordered size 12 align 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: reordered size 8 align 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: nested size 16 align 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: withunion size 24 align 8
'' GOLDEN: expected/udt.out
